 "origem": "autoral (argila expansiva: encolhe na seca e incha na chuva; estacas abaixo da zona ativa, viga baldrame com vão; árvores longe da casa). Fonte geral: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expansive_clay",
 "titulo": "You built a house on clay. Summer cracked it. 🏚️ #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A HOUSE ON CLAY",
 "descripcion": "Clay shrinks in summer and swells in winter, and your house goes up and down with it. From patched cracks to deep piles and a floor hanging over an air gap, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #foundation #clay #howitworks #shorts",
